  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 22,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "2",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2PE 2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "2",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi baprofete ba mashimi bakabika munkatshi mua bantu kabidi, bu mudi bayishi ba mashimi balua kubika munkatshi muenu, nebalue mu musokoko ne malu manutahulule ku dibutuke, bavila Mukelenge wakabahikula, badivuishila dibutuka dia lukasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bantu ba bungi nebalonde bienzenza biabo bia masandi; bua bualu buabo nshila wa bushua neahendibue. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu bua lukuka lua biuma bobo nebendulule nʼenu mushinga ne mei a mashimi; dihila diabo diakabahishabo nʼadi kale kadiena dishanguluka, ne dibutuke diabo kadiena dilala tulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu bua bikala Nzambi kai muengeleke banjelo hakenzabo bibi, kadi yeye wakabela mu Ngena ne wakabafila mu nyongola ya mîdima, bua balamibuemu tô ne ku dilumbuluisha diabo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne bikalaye kai muengeleke ba ha buloba ba kale, kadi wakalama Noa, muambi wa malu mimpe ne bantu bakuabo muanda mutekete hakatumeye mai manene ha buloba bua bantu babi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne hakandamusheye misoko ya Sodoma ne Amola butue bua kahia, wakaihisha ne dibutuka, wakaivuisha bu tshifuanyikishi kudi bantu balualua kuhidia Nzambi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne wakahandisha Lota, muntu muakane hakadiye mutatshishibue ku bienzedi bia bundu bia bashihi ba mikenshi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(bualu bua muntu eu muakane mushikame munkatshi muabo, mu dimona diandi ne mu diunvua diandi wakadi unyingalasha mutshima wandi muakane ku dituku ku dituku ne bienzedi bia bantombueshi); ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukelenge udi mumanye mua kuhandisha bantu bandi bimpe mu mateyi abo, ne mua kulama bantu babi mu dikenga tô ne halua dituku dia kulumbulula; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yeye udi utamba kukengesha bantu badi balonda malu a mubidi mu lukuka ludi lubabihisha, ne badi bahetula bukokeshi. Badi bena dikamakama ne badisu, kabena bazakala hakahendabo badi ne butumbi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kadi banjelo, badi babahita bunene ne bukole, kabena balua ne dihisha didi dibahenda ku mpala kua Mukelenge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi bayishi aba, bu badi kabai ne meshi, baledibua bu nyama mene, bua kuikuatabo ne bua kuishihabo, badi bahendi mu malu adibo kabai bamanye, mu dijimisha diabo nebajimishibue bulelela, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "badi bakengeshibua bu difutu dia kuenza kua malu mabi abo; bantu badi babala kutamba kudia kuabo ne kunua kuabo kua mu munya bu disanka; badi matobe ne bilema, batamba kudia ne kunua ku bidia bia dinanga hadiabo nʼenu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "badi ne mesu mûle tente ne masandi, ne adi kâi mamanye mua kulekela malu mabi; badi balekesha badi ne mitshima mitekete; badi ne mitshima yabo mibidila mu lukuka; badi bana badi ne mulau. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakalekelabo nshila mululame, bakahambuka, bamane kulonda nshila wa Belama, muana wa Beo, wakasua difutu dia bienzedi bibi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kadi yeye wakadi mubedibue bua malu mabi andi; mpundu wakadi kamama wakakula mukana bu muatu, kakakanda buhote bua muprofete. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba badi mishimi kayi ne mai; badi bu dibungi dihata kudi tshihehele tshikole; kudibo babatekela bufike bua mîdima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu bua hadibo bakula mei manene a diambu, ku bienzedi biabo bia masandi, badi balobesha bakuabo mu nkuka ya mubidi, mbobo badi bamba kuhanduka kudi badi balonda dihambuka; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "badi babalaya budishikaminyi, hadi bobo bine bahika ba malu mabole; bualu bua muntu udi mubuesha mu buhika kudi tshidiye mutambibue buhole. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu bua, hakamanabo kuhanduka mu malu a ha buloba, kumanya kuabo kua Mukelenge ne Musungidi, Yesu Kilisto, biakuatshibuabo mu malu â kabidi ne biatambibuabo bukole, tshikadilu tshiabo tshia kunshikidilu tshidi tshitamba tshia kumudilu bubi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Biakadi bitamba buimpe bua bobo kabai banze kumanya nshila wa buakane, ne hakamumanyabo, bua bobo kuela nyima ku mukenshi wa tshijila wakabelelabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2PE 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu buakulua kudibo bu mudi lusumuinu lulelela luamba ne, Mbua muhingane ku bilushi biandi kabidi, ne ngulube mumane kuowa wakahingana kudibonda mu bitahikidi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2PE.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2PE.2.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
